{"pageid": 436, "title": "AndWorld Design", "revid": 991, "categories": [], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 250px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/4/46/AndWorld_Design.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241102160119\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"AndWorld Design\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/4/46/AndWorld_Design.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20241102160119\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"167\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"AndWorld Design.jpg\" data-image-key=\"AndWorld_Design.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:AndWorld_Design.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>AndWorld Design</b> is a lettering studio that handles the lettering on the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series, as well as its <a href=\"/wiki/Slaughterverse\" title=\"Slaughterverse\">Slaughterverse</a> spinoffs.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Studio_members\">Studio members</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Deron Bennett: Owner</li>\n<li>Kat Vendetti: Editor</li>\n<li>Marlon B.: Social Media Design Coordinator</li>\n<li>Morgan Martinez: Multi-disciplinary Art Director, Data Visualization Analyst</li>\n<li>DC Hopkins: Letterer and Designer</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5f/Website.png/revision/latest?cb=20230223192639